WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.493 --> 00:00:17.778
While Zann, Perda, and Gliss were beginning to panic, Darb appeared calm.

2
00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:19.858
"Don't worry," he said.

3
00:00:19.878 --> 00:00:22.199
"I think I can get us back to the wormhole."

4
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.580
"How?" Gliss cried.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.661
"We can't use magic!"

6
00:00:27.722 --> 00:00:28.642
Darb smiled.

7
00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.463
"I can't ever use magic.

8
00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.243
I'm used to living without it.

9
00:00:32.644 --> 00:00:33.324
Give me a minute."

10
00:00:34.144 --> 00:00:36.946
He squinted up toward the sun and then glanced around.

11
00:00:36.966 --> 00:00:38.928
"What's he doing?"

12
00:00:39.128 --> 00:00:39.809
Perda whispered.

13
00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:41.770
Zann shrugged.

14
00:00:42.191 --> 00:00:43.191
"Let's wait and see."

15
00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:45.253
Darb looked up again.

16
00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:48.776
Then he closed his eyes and just stood there for a moment.

17
00:00:48.796 --> 00:00:51.158
"Okay," he said at last.

18
00:00:51.178 --> 00:00:52.579
"I think it's this way."

19
00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.362
Zann and the girls followed as Darb led the way.

20
00:00:58.644 --> 00:01:00.365
After a moment Darb paused.

21
00:01:00.766 --> 00:01:03.208
He looked around and then closed his eyes again.

22
00:01:04.108 --> 00:01:07.289
When he opened them, he made a turn and then walked some more.

23
00:01:07.309 --> 00:01:13.571
"I think he's using his non-magical senses to try to find his way back to the wormhole," Zann

24
00:01:13.611 --> 00:01:14.691
told the others softly.

25
00:01:14.711 --> 00:01:16.972
"That's right," Darb said.

26
00:01:16.992 --> 00:01:21.653
"The sun was just above our left shoulders when we were walking up the hill, so now I'm

27
00:01:21.713 --> 00:01:23.254
trying to keep it just to our right."

28
00:01:24.294 --> 00:01:28.155
Within minutes Zann spotted a slight shimmer in the air up ahead.

29
00:01:28.175 --> 00:01:29.895
"The wormhole!"

30
00:01:30.055 --> 00:01:30.536
he shouted.

31
00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:31.556
"There it is!"

32
00:01:32.904 --> 00:01:35.046
"Whew!" Gliss sounded relieved.

33
00:01:35.066 --> 00:01:37.167
"We're lucky you found it, Darb.

34
00:01:37.627 --> 00:01:39.709
Our landmarks are nowhere in sight!"

35
00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:41.750
Zann nodded.

36
00:01:42.191 --> 00:01:45.133
The scenery looked very different than it had when they'd arrived.

37
00:01:46.153 --> 00:01:48.075
But he didn't really care about that anymore.

38
00:01:48.095 --> 00:01:50.717
"Let's get out of here," he said.

39
00:01:50.737 --> 00:01:53.639
"Are you sure we've rested enough?"

40
00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:54.619
Gliss asked.

41
00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:56.801
"No," Perda said.

42
00:01:56.821 --> 00:01:58.482
"But I agree with Zann.

43
00:01:58.522 --> 00:02:02.008
We need to get to Skellia and help Ello."

44
00:02:02.028 --> 00:02:05.151
They shackled themselves together and dived into the wormhole.

45
00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:11.356
Almost immediately Zann realized they should have rested for longer.

46
00:02:11.676 --> 00:02:12.437
He felt weak.

47
00:02:13.417 --> 00:02:15.899
He and his friends careened wildly around.

48
00:02:15.919 --> 00:02:18.301
"This is terrible!"

49
00:02:18.561 --> 00:02:19.222
Gliss shouted.

50
00:02:19.242 --> 00:02:21.864
"We have to find a place to rest."

51
00:02:21.884 --> 00:02:26.008
"Just grab the first world we pass," Darb called out.

52
00:02:26.608 --> 00:02:27.969
"No!" Perda cried.

53
00:02:27.989 --> 00:02:33.061
"What if we end up back in Fardark?"

54
00:02:33.081 --> 00:02:34.362
"No way that's happening!"

55
00:02:34.642 --> 00:02:35.383
Zann declared.

56
00:02:36.003 --> 00:02:40.487
Fardark was a creepy world full of horrible creatures, like scatter beasts.

57
00:02:41.568 --> 00:02:44.971
Perda was right—they couldn't risk landing somewhere like that.

58
00:02:45.352 --> 00:02:46.593
But they had to stop soon.

59
00:02:46.613 --> 00:02:49.055
"Give me that," he blurted out.

60
00:02:49.615 --> 00:02:51.297
He grabbed the guidelink from Perda.

61
00:02:52.978 --> 00:02:57.142
With the last of his energy, he focused on soothing, intelligent magic.

62
00:02:58.343 --> 00:03:02.565
A second later he felt the device tugging him toward an upcoming wormhole.

63
00:03:03.765 --> 00:03:06.826
Moments later they tumbled out into another world.

64
00:03:07.926 --> 00:03:10.047
This one looked similar to Magica too.

65
00:03:10.487 --> 00:03:12.668
But it smelled completely different.

66
00:03:12.688 --> 00:03:15.429
"Ugh!" Gliss held her nose.

67
00:03:15.449 --> 00:03:19.010
"It's Niffia!"

68
00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.390
Zann grabbed his own nose.

69
00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.931
He'd recognize Niffia anywhere.

70
00:03:24.031 --> 00:03:27.052
It was the stinkiest world he'd ever smelled!

71
00:03:28.116 --> 00:03:29.837
"I wish we could try again."

72
00:03:30.338 --> 00:03:31.759
Perda glanced at the wormhole.

73
00:03:31.779 --> 00:03:36.743
"But I think we'll have to make the best of it until we're rested."

74
00:03:36.763 --> 00:03:40.386
"At least the people in this world are friendly."

75
00:03:40.726 --> 00:03:41.626
Darb pointed.

76
00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:43.908
"Look, here come some Niffians now."

77
00:03:47.891 --> 00:03:49.593
The Niffians smiled brightly.

78
00:03:49.613 --> 00:03:52.695
"Welcome back, my young friends!"

79
00:03:53.035 --> 00:03:53.676
the leader said.

80
00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:58.790
"We're so happy that you've chosen to return to our beautiful world."

81
00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.151
Zann forced a smile.

82
00:04:01.531 --> 00:04:04.032
He'd stopped holding his nose when the Niffians had arrived.

83
00:04:04.052 --> 00:04:06.233
"Thank you," he said.

84
00:04:06.253 --> 00:04:09.555
"We needed a nice place to rest and restore our energy."

85
00:04:09.575 --> 00:04:14.497
"You've come to the right world," another Niffian said, beaming.

86
00:04:14.517 --> 00:04:17.958
"Please come with us and share some food and drink."

87
00:04:19.579 --> 00:04:22.020
The kids followed the Niffians to the nearest town.

88
00:04:23.772 --> 00:04:29.174
As they ate, Zann and his friends told the Niffians about their adventures since their last visit to

89
00:04:29.234 --> 00:04:34.937
Niffia. When Zann mentioned Wyssa, the Niffians looked more delighted than ever.

90
00:04:34.957 --> 00:04:37.518
"Ah, Wyssa!"

91
00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:38.478
one of them cried.

92
00:04:38.498 --> 00:04:41.039
"How is our most esteemed friend?"

93
00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.440
"We're not sure."

94
00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.501
Zann traded a look with his friends.

95
00:04:46.402 --> 00:04:53.192
During their first visit to Niffia, they'd been surprised to find out how much the Niffians liked Wyssa.

96
00:04:53.212 --> 00:04:55.554
She'd never seemed very friendly to Zann or the others.

97
00:04:55.574 --> 00:05:00.678
"We haven't seen her since she left Magica with Morb," Perda said.

98
00:05:00.698 --> 00:05:04.641
"Morb." One of the Niffians frowned slightly.

99
00:05:04.661 --> 00:05:06.102
"Ah, yes.

100
00:05:06.862 --> 00:05:12.726
I believe that was the name of her, um, companion during her most recent visit."

101
00:05:13.947 --> 00:05:14.988
Zann was surprised.

102
00:05:15.008 --> 00:05:16.769
"Wyssa brought Morb here?"

103
00:05:16.789 --> 00:05:20.092
"Only briefly," another Niffian said.

104
00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.141
He and the others suddenly looked much more solemn than usual.

105
00:05:24.161 --> 00:05:28.984
"She stopped only long enough to collect a bit of pupu leaf."

106
00:05:29.004 --> 00:05:31.525
"Pupu leaf?"

107
00:05:31.765 --> 00:05:32.485
Perda echoed.

108
00:05:32.505 --> 00:05:33.866
"What's that for?"

109
00:05:34.806 --> 00:05:36.607
The Niffians exchanged glances.

110
00:05:36.627 --> 00:05:39.708
"We didn't ask why she needed it," one said.

111
00:05:39.728 --> 00:05:47.692
"However," another added, "the pupu is mostly used for spells involving immobilization."

112
00:05:48.936 --> 00:05:53.579
Zann shuddered as he remembered Wyssa's threat to feed Morb to a scatter beast.

113
00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.742
Was that why she'd needed the pupu?

114
00:05:57.222 --> 00:06:00.645
To immobilize him long enough for the fearsome creature to find him?

115
00:06:00.665 --> 00:06:03.607
"So," the Niffian leader said.

116
00:06:03.627 --> 00:06:07.069
"Why are you four traveling through the vortex again?"

117
00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:12.493
Zann told the Niffians about their current mission to find Skellia and help Ello.

118
00:06:12.513 --> 00:06:19.225
"We'll fetch you some oogberry," one Niffian said, while another rushed off toward the forest.

119
00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:23.687
"That's an important ingredient in searching spells."

120
00:06:23.707 --> 00:06:27.008
"Just relax for now though."

121
00:06:27.268 --> 00:06:28.629
The Niffian leader smiled.

122
00:06:28.649 --> 00:06:30.930
"We'll take care of everything."

123
00:06:32.351 --> 00:06:36.732
For the next hour, Zann did his best to rest and ignore the stink.

124
00:06:37.853 --> 00:06:42.395
He and his friends were talking about Niffia when Zann's head exploded in pain.

125
00:06:42.895 --> 00:06:45.156
Clutching his forehead, he groaned.

126
00:06:46.488 --> 00:06:47.909
"Zann!" Perda cried.

127
00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.171
Zann hardly heard her.

128
00:06:51.172 --> 00:06:53.694
He fell to the floor, landing on the guidelink.

129
00:06:55.055 --> 00:06:57.517
Ello's frightened face appeared in his mind.

130
00:06:57.537 --> 00:07:00.179
"Help!" Ello wailed.

131
00:07:00.199 --> 00:07:01.740
"Please, hurry!"

132
00:07:02.801 --> 00:07:04.222
Zann grabbed the guidelink.

133
00:07:04.242 --> 00:07:05.363
"We're coming!"

134
00:07:05.604 --> 00:07:08.666
he cried, even though he knew Ello couldn't hear him.

135
00:07:09.807 --> 00:07:10.467
Or could he?

136
00:07:10.928 --> 00:07:13.110
Immediately Ello's face brightened.

137
00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:17.064
"Hurry!" he said again, before fading away.
